## Core Rule
**Only the sender closes channels.** Receivers never close.

## CORRECT - Sender closes
```go
func generator() <-chan int {
    ch := make(chan int)
    go func() {
        defer close(ch) // Sender closes
        for i := 0; i < 10; i++ {
            ch <- i
        }
    }()
    return ch
}

func main() {
    for num := range generator() {
        fmt.Println(num)
    }
}
